    "detailed_description": "&quot;When I am not with her, I feel alone. When I am with her, I feel even more lonely&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEvery hundred years, a demon known as the Overlord appears in the world and claims a new wife in exchange for not destroying the world, so the persons offers him a girl to marry him and thus leave in peace for another hundred years.<br />\r\nOn this occasion, the victim has been a girl named Meya. But, unable to bear the thought of losing her best friend, Lunafreya, a fifteen-year-old girl, decides to break this terrible tradition and do everything in her power to rescue her.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Third-person adventure and fantasy RPG with real-time combat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 A whole interconnected world to explore with different biomes. Forests, deserts, glaciers...<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Sail across the sea. Explore islands, board pirate ships and find secret treasures.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Side quests that matter: tell the plot, take you through new stories, and allow you to discover new places.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Full of bosses. Can you find and defeat them all?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Multitude of weapons and types of enemies. Equip yourself with your favorite class, learn new skills by leveling up, and take on powerful monsters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Variety of hats and clothing dyes to customize Lunafreya and a magical gem system to unleash new powers.",
